{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/977681-mage-the-awakening-2nd-edition-core-rulebook-images-for-public-use","id":977681,"title":"Mage: the Awakening 2nd edition core rulebook images for public use?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-28T04:03:51-07:00","id":977681,"title":"Mage: the Awakening 2nd edition core rulebook images for public use?","content":"I don't rightly know where to put this, but I would like to ask permission from Andrew Trabbold, Chris Huth, Prisilla Kim, Borja Puig, Linares, Brian Leblanc, Subroto Bhaumik, Joel Biske, Jeff Holt, Chris Bivins, Leo Albiero, and Michael W. Kaluta to use their images as part of advertising my Mage: the Awakening 2nd edition chronicle.<br /> <br /> The images in Mage: the Awakening 2nd edition core rulebook are some of the evocative and inspiring pieces of art that I have seen in my seventeen years of playing o/nWoD and Chronicles of Darkness games. I would very much like to use some of these same images on Facebook and part of an introduction document I have written for my chronicle.<br /> <br /> So, any chance that I may do so?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-28T07:41:09-07:00","id":977754,"title":"","content":"I think that as long as it's for personal use and nothing that you profit from, you're probably ok to use whatever. Don't quote me, but that seems to be the way it has been handled in the past.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1885-crackedman","name":"CrackedMan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1885_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-28T08:08:05-07:00","id":977771,"title":"","content":"I asked some years ago this question to Eddy Web, because I wanted to use some WW images for my Land of the Damned: Spain project. He told me that, as long I did not profit and I recognized the OP propiety of them it was Ok (I don't remember his exact words, that was answered in the old forums).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>LAND OF THE DAMNED: SPAIN (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/3MHWYm\" target=\"_blank\">Land of the Damned: Spain</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/52b0TX\" target=\"_blank\">Kingdoms of Blood: Spain</a>; Cities of the Damned: <a href=\"https://goo.gl/XFMSSe\" target=\"_blank\">Barcelona</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/AXxdgq\" target=\"_blank\">Valencia</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/zkI5a1\" target=\"_blank\">Carthian Constitution</a> (1812), <a href=\"https://goo.gl/5H8M4s\" target=\"_blank\">Three Arrows Pact</a>: <br /> <br /> <b>OTHERS (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/36HngB\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: The Redemption</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/6B9V8l\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Forgotten</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/247-uxas","name":"Uxas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-28T09:25:28-07:00","id":977804,"title":"","content":"OK, first off, not a lawyer (and if you want full legal advice, don't ask an Internet forum):<br /> <br /> 1) In this case, you don't have to go through the artists. It's nice to ask them, but generally speaking their work for the game is, &quot;work for hire,&quot; which means WWP (the new one owned by Paradox) owns the rights to the images.<br /> <br /> 2) Fair use is complicated - esp. because it only comes with guidelines not hard rules - and people vastly overestimate the non-profit approach to fair use. I don't think this is a particular worry for what you seem to want to do, but fair use guidelines regarding money also include simply denying profits to the IP owners even if you're not making any either.<br /> <br /> 3) In best news, WW, CCP, Onyx Path, and now WWP have always been rather open to letting fans use stuff. Onyx Path and WWP have both indicated that they're working on revising the old WW &quot;here's what you can use&quot; rules to make it clear where they see the line. It's always been recognized that giving the fans leeway to use copyrighted material with direct guides on how much lets them balance the important of fan-sites to word of mouth and growing the brands, with the realities of the business world and protecting their property. I'm not sure where a new website stands since the old rules were released in the CCP era (anything created then could at least be argued for grandfathering in if they followed the old rules), but they should probably be a good idea of what's considered &quot;safe&quot; for now:<br /> <br /> Unfortunately when WWP took over the old website and redid it, they took the old guides down and I can't find a good link to them right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-29T06:55:18-07:00","id":978355,"title":"","content":"For the purposes that you've mentioned here, using the images for a personal use introduction page for your players, you'd be well within Fair Use. You're not using the images for a commercial value, are not profiting monetarily, and aren't depriving any profit to WWP, OP, or the artist (whoever ultimately holds the rights still).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7892-malraza","name":"Malraza","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}